&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-924&quot; title=&quot;addEntry() is susceptible to spurious wakeups&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;BOOKKEEPER-924&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;BOOKKEEPER-924&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;  Handle Spurious wakeups&lt;/p&gt;

